urn to your original position.\n\n🔹 Team Teleport\n\nEnter a team name (case-insensitive).\n\nEnables loop teleportation that keeps you behind the first valid member of that team.\n\nIf no valid team member is found, teleportation pauses until one becomes available.\n\nWhen the loop ends, you also return to your original position.\n\n⚙️ Features\n\n✅ Smooth Rayfield UI with tabs for Player and Team teleports\n\n✅ Smart filtering for ForceFields and dead players\n\n✅ Position memory (teleports you back after loop toggle off)\n\n✅ AI-style structure, optimized for executors (not Studio only)","tags":["teleport","hub"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6769e469290fd17f33e179b7","username":"ChatGpt_ScriptMaker","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f0b2ea16c61ccb6e9469b6570128712da46e75b3e1b80b0cbab05e2b930a3936.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6769e469290fd17f33e179b7-1758137414721.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6769e469290fd17f33e179b7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f0b2ea16c61ccb6e9469b6570128712da46e75b3e1b80b0cbab05e2b930a3936.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6769e469290fd17f33e179b7-1758137414721.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T02:54:33.229Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68cb1f124b2a6e251d07fdc0","editBy":{"_id":"6769e469290fd17f33e179b7","username":"ChatGpt_ScriptMaker","status":"offline","id":"6769e469290fd17f33e179b7"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-09-17T20:50:26.167Z"}],"comments":[]}